BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260625T140000Z
DTEND:20260625T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260625T000000Z
SUMMARY:VITA Free Tax Prep - BACK TAXES
DESCRIPTION:Free Tax Prep presented by VITA (Volunteer Income Tax 
 Assistance) and the United Way of Greater Newark.\n\nThis service is 
 available to adults who make $80\,000.00 and under per year. Assistance 
 will be available for filing prior-year returns\, including tax years 
 2023\, 2024\, and 2025. Registration Required - Click to Register  \n\nThis 
 service will run on Thursdays (10 a.m. - 4 p.m.) and Saturdays (10 a.m. - 4 
 p.m.) starting Thursday April 16\, and ending on Saturday\, May 30. \n\nYou 
 can also register by calling 973-566-6200 ext. 215\, or emailing 
 reference@bloomfield.bccls.org\n\n***WHAT TO BRING***\n\nFor married filing 
 jointly\, both spouses must be present Original photo identification such 
 as driver's license\, school\, employer\, military\, or State ID for you 
 and your spouse (if married) Social Security cards or Individual Taxpayer 
 Identification Number documents for you\, your spouse\, and dependents 
 Birth dates for you\, spouse\, and dependents A copy of last year's tax 
 return All Forms W-2 and 1099 Form 1095-A\, if applicable Information for 
 other income Information for all deductions and credits Total paid daycare 
 provider and their tax ID number For direct deposit of refund\, proof of 
 account and bank's routing number For prior year returns\, copies of income 
 transcripts from IRS (and state\, if applicable).
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Conference Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10270-16973666
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/calendar/bloomfield/BackTaxJune
END:VEVENT
