SUMMARY:FREE CONCERT: The Musettes
DESCRIPTION:The Musettes are a recorder ensemble composed of senior 
 citizens that meet in Montclair every week. This is a free to attend 
 concert\, no registration required!\n\nA Message from the Musettes:\n\n"The 
 Musettes ensemble is looking for new players. We also offer recorder 
 lessons for those interested in learning and performing. For more 
 information\, please email info@montclairearlymusic.org."
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Performance
