SUMMARY:Unearth a Magical Story - with Magician Steve Woyce!
DESCRIPTION:Mr. Magician Steve returns to BPL to unearth a magical story\, 
 just in time for our Summer Reading Program!  Help us kick off this annual 
 event and join us in the main library for a dinosaur-themed magic show.  
 All children and their grownups are welcome\; all children under age 12 
 must be accompanied by an adult.
LOCATION:Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-16940740
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16940740
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260629T190000Z
DTEND:20260629T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260629T000000Z
SUMMARY:SUMMER READING KICK OFF PARTY
DESCRIPTION: ARE YOU READY????  \n\nWe are ready to start the party this 
 summer for Bloomfield Public Library’s 2026 Summer Reading Program! The 
 party starts on Monday\, June 29th with the Summer Reading Kick-Off Party 
 happening from 3pm to 6pm!!   \n\n What’s happening? \n\n3PM – 4PM: 
 Magic Show (for children & their grown ups ONLY) \n\n4PM – 5:30PM: DJ 
 Corey\, Food Trucks\, Games and Crafts for all \n\n5:45PM: Teen & Adult 
 Summer Reading Raffle (Drawing #1) \n\nIt’s bound to be a summer full of 
 reading\, adventure and fun for all ages!  \n\nBut the fun doesn’t end 
 there! We have a whole summer PACKED with exciting programs and events to 
 attend! Just by checking out materials or attending our programs\, 
 Bloomfield residents 12  can win weekly raffle prizes and a GRAND PRIZE of 
 a BRAND NEW Lenovo Laptop donated by Arron’s Inc. (located 598 Bloomfield 
 Ave.Bloomfield\, NJ 07003)!!!!!!!!!!!!   \n\nLet’s have some fun and let 
 the reading adventures begin!
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-16839305
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16839305
END:VEVENT
