SUMMARY:Unearth YOUR Story: Genealogy Drop In
DESCRIPTION:Did you always have questions about your grandfather\, or a 
 great-Uncle?  Have you ever wondered where the family skeletons were buried 
 ?   Or are you just wondering about your family roots or personal history?  
 Are you a genealogist with a brick wall?  \n\nDrop in on July 16 @ 11am to 
 learn how to use some genealogical tools such as AncestryLibraryEdition\, 
 FamilySearch\, and your fellow genealogy enthusiasts.  Come ready to ask 
 questions (and learn solutions).  Individual appts with the library's 
 genealogy specialist can also be arranged.  \n\nRegister here\, or email 
 lisa.cohn@bloomfield.bccls.org with any questions
