SUMMARY:Wax in the Stacks - Record Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Bloomfield Public Library for the 1st meeting of 
 the Wax in the Stacks Record Club. We will meet at 6:30 pm in the Main 
 Library to discuss and appreciate some excellent music. Drop-In & enjoy the 
 tunes!\n\n Register if you want to bring a record to share with the club. 
 \n\nTo register contact Alex - alex.russo@bloomfield.bccls.org or 
 973-566-6200 ext 215\n\n \n\n
