SUMMARY:Queer Reads and Teas
DESCRIPTION:Join us outside in Bloomfield Public Library's Courtyard with 
 your favorite queer story you've read recently. Grab a free tea or iced 
 coffee and share what you love about your book. Find other people who also 
 love that book or your next several reads! \n\n \n\nIf you are looking for 
 a great place to start call 973-566-6200 x 219 for our LGBTQ  Reading List. 
