BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260826T223000Z
DTEND:20260826T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
SUMMARY:Biblio Bites & Brews (Cookbook Club)
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE NOTE: This event is located at 58 Washington Street\, 
 Bloomfield NJ 07003.\n\nCalling all food lovers! \n\nJoin us at Varitage 
 Brew Works for a fun and flavorful evening with our cookbook club: Biblio 
 Bites & Brews. Each month\, we pick a different cookbook or culinary 
 theme—then gather to share dishes\, swap recipes\, and talk all things 
 food over a cold craft brew.\n\nWhether you're a seasoned home cook or just 
 love trying new flavors\, this is a great way to connect with fellow food 
 enthusiasts in a relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere. Come hungry\, curious\, 
 and ready to discover your next favorite recipe!\n\nRegistration is 
 REQUIRED. Copies of this months cookbook will be available for checkout at 
 the circulation desk.\n\n**Please register using a valid email 
 address—important details about meetings and recipe sign-ups will be sent 
 to you.**\n\nEmail jennie.sudia@bloomfield.bccls.org with any questions.
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Book Club
UID:LibCal-10270-17040002
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17040002
END:VEVENT
